.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt TPUT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm tput
.Nd query ANSI terminal capabilities
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl T Ar type
.Ar capname
.Op Ar parameter ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility writes the terminal sequence or numeric value for
.Ar capname .
The
.Fl T
option overrides the
.Ev TERM
environment value.
.Pp
Supported capabilities are
.Cm clear , cup , bold , sgr0 , smso , rmso , smul , rmul , el , ed ,
.Cm bel , cols
and
.Cm lines .
.Cm cup
takes the row and column parameters.
An unknown capability exits with status 1; usage errors exit with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tabs 1
